"id": "1830449300822153", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982610_1830449304155486_9105627070072408848_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1lUadEyf1DYQ7kNvwF-gMQf&_nc_oc=AdplUFH89tN0ckFh3r5DPwW-kvSN_0brDRtpZ-wjZT0JbmfczExTKKI0HF0hnrEKqM0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMOMP8wB2Mtanf0Pk4-Gik7i2mvGYwJnfu-bLUfoQxhhA&oe=6AE2130A"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-13.png", "id": "9449026898446045", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_9449026905112711_4579666727095828995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LMQgAgwMgJsQ7kNvwGou7De&_nc_oc=AdqO-koqRPZTUD8kzaCZmN6XPpZ6iT2yG1WqvjpGJbo9Fq5uFBlYkCZVE68Oz84S0cE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO4lMI-JGXCOfQDSsp5aRo1INDVxqIptzxIMl1nCbuHRA&oe=6AE1EB04"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-11.png", "id": "1969264830167481", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974803_1969264833500814_717700601129842921_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gH8zSEeYcQIQ7kNvwFoZtiK&_nc_oc=AdqO9R6fIij5J7LatfABUKI1u_WTirrFxFrzqHd83d2s30BYfl9VyMjDqBArYyIu0e8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN8yTb0XCtagirBBBCK5ONG3wfnfNBgXSklfxj95lS6VA&oe=6AE1F0DE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Squingle_Demo_v2_Cover_Landscape.png", "id": "964144373025532", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292232_964144376358865_8987889214839571925_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J7EsTL1XIRkQ7kNvwGL3Mzd&_nc_oc=Adqx6cJCuQ9j7s2DRGbVyxMpgGXqN4irR-F9kfFoCPK-z3Gle_x0lQLKPucwuSdcn8A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO76Sd2u0wVQWdLYizpgQ_NZL61wTgoal-EX_wW9G94ZQ&oe=6AE1EDA7"}, "display_name": "Squingle Demo", "keywords": ["puzzle", "MR", "puzzling", "demo", "squingle"], "long_description": "Squingle Demo, offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing, glass-like sculpture that comes to life in either Mixed Reality or a fully immersive environment, offering an unmatched visual experience in the puzzle genre.\n\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 ACCESSIBILITY\nDesigned to be accessible for a wide range of players and skill levels, with intuitive controls and hand-tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c GLOBAL LEADERBOARD\nCompete on the Squingle Demo Leaderboard! See the sum of your best times across all levels and compare them with others around the globe.\n\n \n# \ud83d\udc7b RACE YOUR GHOST\nChallenge your best times on each level to improve your leaderboard rank for endless fun!\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf00 Immerse yourself in the world of Squingle, where every twist presents a new challenge! \ud83c\udf20", "short_description": "Squingle Demo offers an incredible bite-sized experience of the unique Mixed Reality 3D puzzle game, Squingle. \n\nEmbark on a journey where the lines between the virtual and real worlds blur, offering endless fun and mind-bending challenges.\n\nGuide the orbs from start to finish, avoid the edges, and collect points as you navigate through glass-like mazes called \u2018Squingles.\u2019\ud83c\udf20"}]}, "developer_name": "Dr. Benjamin Outram ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://squingle.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRAL Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://squingle.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "c